    docs: document normalize-board events.jsonl prerequisite (DF-BOARDCTL-42)
    
    The README normalize-board section now correctly states that board
    resolution requires tasks.jsonl + events.jsonl only — board.jsonl is
    optional (topology A vs B). A tasks.jsonl-only board fails with rc=2
    and the events.jsonl-missing hint.
    
    Addresses DF-BOARDCTL-42.
    
